    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d666">

                <pb facs="0547" n="465" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg465"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/1499.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-04-21"><hi rendition="#italic">April 21,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 481.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to this embassy’s telegram
                    of the 20th instant, 11 p.m., relative to the reply of the Mexican foreign
                    office to my note sent in the matter of the fatalities resulting from the battle
                    of Agua Prieta, I have the honor to forward to the Department herewith a copy in
                    the original and in translation of a subsequent note from the foreign office in
                    the same matter.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry Lane
                    Wilson</hi>.</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d666-a1.xml" xpointer="d666-a1"/>
